SUMMARY:The Saturday Night Haunted Halloween Costume Bash! 🎃👻🦇
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nGet ready for 
 a spooky and unforgettable **Halloween Saturday night filled with great mu
 sic\, dancing\, DJ\, Live Band\, costumes\, laughter and opportunities to 
 meet new people!**\n\n**Halloween** falls on a Saturday this year\, so we'
 re making a full evening of it!\nWe'll begin at **Harp Pub and Café\,** r
 ight next door to Harp Tavern\, where we'll mingle with friends old and ne
 w\, admire everyone's costumes and dance the night away!\n\n\\*We'll head 
 to **Smoke Show** later on in the night too\, for more Live music and danc
 ing!\n\n**Date: Saturday\, October 31\, 2026**\n**Location: Harp Pub and C
 afé\, next door to Harp Tavern**\n**174 Eglinton Avenue East\, Toronto**\
 n(Please mention Steve with Meetup when you arrive.)\nArrival Time: Please
  arrive between 8:30 pm and 10 pm (if you can)\n\nCome on your own\, bring
  a friend or arrive with a group. Everyone is welcome\, with plenty of opp
 ortunities to mingle\, dance and make new connections.\n\n\\*Arrive early 
 for dinner if you like- Please mention you are with Steve's group if you d
 o\n\nJoined by my other groups too! :)\n\n***\n\nDetails below:\n\nSincere
 ly\,\n\nDJ Steve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\n🎃 EVENT DETAILS\n**Event
 : The Saturday Night Haunted Halloween Costume Bash!**\n\n👻 **WHAT TO E
 XPECT:**\n\n* A festive Halloween atmosphere with plenty of costumes and H
 alloween spirit\n* Great retro music and dancing with DJ Steve Flemming\n*
  Mingling\, laughter\, conversation and new friendships\n* A welcoming atm
 osphere for singles\, couples and groups of friends\n* A chance to show of
 f your Halloween costume\n* A great 2nd location with Live Band and more D
 ancing! :)\n\n**Event Fee:** $10 per person (with costume) payable in cash
  at the door or by e-transfer in advance to Steveflemming11@gmail.com\n$15
  dollars (without a costume)\n\nLooking forward to seeing everyone there!
