 r clear of political debates!\n\nWhether you're outgoing or a little reser
 ved\, everyone is welcome to share their thoughts\, exchange ideas and enj
 oy some refreshing drinks in a comfortable\, welcoming atmosphere.\n\nDate
 : Sunday\, November 15\, 2026\nArrival Time: 6:00 PM\nLocation: The Pheasa
 nt: A Firkin Pub\nAddress: 1999 Avenue Road\, Toronto\nMeeting Area: Back 
 dining area\n\nJoined by my other social groups too :)\nLooking forward to
